  "fullDescription": "CANVA 2027 Monthly Planner templates are ready to print or to use as KDP interior.\n\nYou can create an unlimited combination of pages with these templates to make your unique planner/s.\n\nYou will receive the following:\nMore than 40 templates – A4 size – CANVA editable:\n⭐️ Account Information\n⭐️ Contact List\n⭐️ Password Tracker\n⭐️ Yearly Overview (2 Pages)\n⭐️ Yearly Plan (2 Pages)\n⭐️ Future Log (4 Pages)\n⭐️ Important Date (2 Pages)\n⭐️ Monthly At a Glance (12 Pages)\n⭐️ Weekly Planner (24 Pages)\n⭐️ My Weekly Tracker (12 Pages & Duplicatable)\n⭐️ Daily Planner (1 Page & Duplicatable)\n⭐️ Habit tracker (5 Pages)\n⭐️ Budget Planner (8 Pages)\n⭐️ Meal Planner & Grocery List (3 Pages)\n⭐️ Sleep Tracker\n⭐️ Mood Tracker\n⭐️ Food Journal (1 Page)\n⭐️ Travel Planner (4 Pages)\n⭐️ 2027 Monday Start Calendar (13 Pages)\n⭐️ And Much More\n\nThis template can be edited with a free Canva account. You can easily change colors, fonts, arrange the pages, add the pages you need, delete the ones you don’t, add any elements and twists, and create your own planner. You will need basic knowledge of Canva to use this template. You will need to edit this template on your computer. You can sign up for a FREE.\n\nYou can either print the PDFs as they are and start planning.\n\nYou will get 2 files.\n1 PDF file contains the Canva template. For 2027 monthly planner (Monday Start Calendar), Fully Editable\n1 PDF file contains BASIC CANVA TEMPLATE EDITING GUIDE\n\nHOW IT WORKS:\n1. Download your file after purchase\n2. Click the link in the PDF\n3. Create a free account with Canva (if you don’t already have one)\n4. Edit the template: font, color, social media handle, and more\n5. Print at home or by using a printing service (Canva does offer printing)\n\n🌟 Here’s a quick rundown of what else you can do:\n• Put your name on the product. Add your logo and branding.\n• Modify the pages.\n\nTHIS IS A DIGITAL ITEM FOR INSTANT DOWNLOAD AND NO PHYSICAL ITEM WILL BE SHIPPED!\n\nMake sure your machine is compatible before purchasing!\n\nNOTE: All printers print differently! We can’t guarantee your printer will match the exact colors you see on your screen.\n\n*****Canva link with template can NOT be resold AS IS. Only YOUR OWN customized product derived from this template can be resold.*****\n\nShare your project made with this product!",
